<title>RUSSIA: TABLE - Russian wage arrears slightly lower in July.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Russian wage arrears slightly lower in July.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Russian wage arrears due to a lack of financing from federal or regional governments fell to 10.94 trillion roubles ($2 billion) on August 1 from 11.35 trillion on July 1, the State Statistics Committee said on Friday.</p>
<p> RUSSIAN WAGE ARREARS		AUG 1	 JUL 1</p>
<p> wage arrears (government)	 10,940	11,354</p>
<p> wage arrears (companies)	  43,652	43,976</p>
<p> wage arrears (total)		54,592	55,330</p>
<p>NOTE - figures in billions of roubles. ($ = 5,813 roubles)</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
